ws/another-step-towards-elm-v1)\r\n\r\n**There are no language changes**, so once you swap to `\"elm-version\": \"0.19.3\"` in your `elm.json` file, you should be able to proceed without any further code changes.\r\n\r\n### Install\r\n\r\nThe links below include (1) a Mac and Windows installer and (2) 64-bit binaries for various platforms.\r\n\r\n✨ [Install](https://guide.elm-lang.org/install/elm.html) ✨\r\n\r\nFor examples of downloading the binaries directly, read the instructions [here](https://github.com/elm/compiler/tree/main/installers/linux) or [here](https://github.com/elm/compiler/tree/main/installers/mac).","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elm/compiler/releases/401862028/reactions","total_count":37,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":4,"hooray":12,"confused":0,"heart":11,"rocket":10,"eyes":0}}